<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - April 23.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - April 23.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on April 23:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		   Ship	  Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Molasses	 4,863/--- (LDD) 3,637/---   Monte Christo   20/04</p>
<p>General	    ---/475 (LDD)   ---/303   Tiger Creek     21/04</p>
<p>Potash	   7,873/--- (ULD)18,219/---   Milenaki	  22/04</p>
<p>Urea	    15,336/--- (ULD) 3,879/---   Lena-II	   13/04</p>
<p>Coal	    19,512/--- (ULD)   500/---   Aditya Gautam   20/04</p>
<p>Coal	    18,351/--- (ULD)13,041/---   Tamil Kamaraj   21/04</p>
<p>Coal	     9,010/--- (ULD)15,430/---   Tamil Periyar   21/04</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
